The root cause is now concrete: this sandbox reports a PID namespace ID that is absent from its mounted `/proc`, while Lean 4.22 resolves its own executable via `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`. A minimal probe reproduced `ENOENT`. I’m applying a narrow, logged preload shim that redirects only that self-executable lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not intercept files, theorem text, or compiler output.
